__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
target/
lcov.info
.DS_Store
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
# cargo-mutants writes its report here; see CONTRIBUTING. A second run renames
# the first's directory rather than deleting it, so both names are here.
mutants.out/
mutants.out.old/

# `uv run --no-project` is how every Python line in this repository is spelt --
# in .pre-commit-config.yaml and in .github/workflows/test.yml -- and
# `--no-project` means uv resolves nothing and reads no lockfile. Running uv
# here anyway writes a uv.lock holding this package and no dependencies, which
# is a resolution of nothing that nobody consults.
#
# Committing it would put a file in the tree that reads as the pinned set the
# builds use and is not. The scripts under scripts/ are stdlib-only and the
# wheel is built by maturin from Cargo.toml, so there is no dependency here for
# a lock to be about. If one is ever added, this line is what to delete.
uv.lock
